From eefe122360837c12c3ae5a16869bb4b226d24bdf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ryoma-89 <ryoma-89@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 21:21:53 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 16/16] velox: accept ray tracing library interfaces and never
 pass null pipelines to the driver (KI-31, patch 0016)

pLibraryInterface only carries payload and attribute sizes and is valid
without pipeline libraries; rejecting it returned null pipelines that the
guest later queried, and the NVIDIA driver dereferenced the null pipeline in
vkGetRayTracingShaderGroupHandlesKHR. Shader group handle and stack size
queries and pipeline binds now reject null pipelines. VELOX_VK_TRACE_FILE
records decoded commands with a flush per line for crash diagnosis.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: Ieb17a43092bf587511744d3522bd993e269ac487
